{
  "id": "eelweir_nesh_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She is mending a trap that does not need mending. \"You'll be going over the bridge. Everyone's going over the bridge.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "Six huts, and smoke from one of them. \"If you've come for eels you're two months late and so am I.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ask_why",
          "text": "Why are you still here in Frostfall?",
          "effects": [
            {
              "emit": {
                "event": "startQuest",
                "data": {
                  "quest": "eelweir_out_of_season"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_reach",
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "eelweir_out_of_season",
                "status": "unstarted"
              },
              {
                "quest": "the_open_door",
                "status": "complete"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_eels",
          "text": "Tell me about the eels.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_eels"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [
        {
          "requires": {
            "flags": [
              {
                "flag": "eelweir_chapel_cleared",
                "equals": true
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "after_the_chapel"
        },
        {
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "eelweir_the_barge",
                "status": "active"
              }
            ],
            "flags": [
              {
                "flag": "eelweir_barge_found",
                "equals": true
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "about_the_barge"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the_reach",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Eels run this reach every Harvest and have done since there was a bridge to run under. This Harvest they came up to the chapel and turned round.\" She sets the trap down. \"Eels do not turn round.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "what_is_there",
          "text": "What's in the chapel?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "what_is_there"
        },
        {
          "id": "go",
          "text": "We'll walk out and see.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "go_and_see"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "what_is_there",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Water to the sill and something in it that is not eels.\" She looks at the river rather than at you. \"I put a light in there in Lastmonth and it went out from underneath.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "go",
          "text": "We'll walk out and see.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "go_and_see"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "go_and_see",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Go at the low. It's a wade either way but at the high it's a swim, and I'd not swim it.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "We'll go at the low.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "the_eels",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Silver in Harvest, and worth a mark the pound in Aurenhal because the Kingshold will not eat river fish that hasn't come up past a chapel.\" A dry look. \"Do not ask me why. I take the mark.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "text": "Hm.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "after_the_chapel",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"You've been out.\" She reads your boots. \"And you came back, which is more than the light did.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "what_they_were",
          "text": "There were three of them.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": true,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "up_the_reach"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "It's dealt with.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [],
      "remembers": "ward_restored"
    },
    {
      "id": "up_the_reach",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Three,\" she says. \"And they came up the reach, and a thing that comes up a reach came from somewhere further down it.\" She wipes her hands. \"There's a barge on its side in the Oxbow. Went down loaded in my grandfather's time and nobody ever got the cargo out. I have wondered about that barge for thirty years.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "take_it",
          "text": "We'll go and look at your barge.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "emit": {
                "event": "startQuest",
                "data": {
                  "quest": "eelweir_the_barge"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_oxbow",
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "eelweir_the_barge",
                "status": "unstarted"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "later",
          "text": "Later, maybe.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "the_oxbow",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Low water, west bank, under the willow that went through the deck.\" She almost smiles. \"You will not find it from the path. Nobody ever does.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "We'll find it.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "about_the_barge",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"You found her, then.\" Nesh does not sound pleased about it. \"And?\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "the_stone",
          "text": "It was carrying cut stone. Away from the hedge country.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": true,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_stone"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "the_stone",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Cut stone,\" she repeats. \"Out of the hedges. Nobody quarries the hedges, there's nothing there but clay and badgers.\" She is quiet for a moment. \"Somebody was taking something *out*. And they sank rather than land it.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "the_hole",
          "text": "Where would it have come from?",
          "effects": [
            {
              "emit": {
                "event": "startQuest",
                "data": {
                  "quest": "eelweir_the_badger_hole"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_hedge_bank",
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "eelweir_the_badger_hole",
                "status": "unstarted"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "the_hedge_bank",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"There's a hole under a hedge bank in the four-lane country. Tam's terrier went in after a badger last spring and came out the far side of the field.\" She looks up. \"That is a very long way for a badger to have dug.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "We'll follow it in.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "adjustReputation": {
                "faction": "the_keepers",
                "amount": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [],
      "remembers": "ward_restored"
    }
  ]
}
